Placeholder so this directory exists in a fresh checkout.

testapp/nuget.config registers ../artifacts/local-feed as a NuGet source, and
NuGet fails a restore (NU1301) when a local source directory is missing — even
in `local` mode, which never reads from this feed. scripts/e2e-pack.sh fills it
with SchematicHQ.Client.0.0.0-e2e.nupkg for the E2E `pack` mode.

Packages here are gitignored.
